 :  %d\n\t\tCurrent Anomaly Chance :  %d%%","source_tag":"tformat","target":"设置自己的紊乱值。\n\t\t休息或等待时，你每回合将自动调节 %d 点紊乱值趋向于你的设定值。\n\t\t你的紊乱值修正率影响所有时空法术的持续时间和法术强度。\n\n\t\t设定的紊乱值：%d\n\t\t紊乱值修正率：%d%%\n\t\t时空法术强度：%d\n\t\t意志修正数值：-%d\n\t\t紊乱维持数值：+%d\n\t\t修正后紊乱值：%d\n\t\t当前异常几率：%d%%"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e5878ce9078230abb18f71cb28a3f14c915a34a0314b773754a44576fd1bda5e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"31150acbde56cbe3dbabebb7d257b2fb1d38c5b8d22025027d3317fba060f265","logical_entry_identity":"7517e0a18ba1a4d349a5365825f277ff4e513f4312d3df3339ce2bcfa404560e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"\"From bellow, it devours.\"","source_tag":"_t","target":"“来自深渊，吞噬四方。”"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a2368fb499dfb7b67a3e9c9979538018b4be597ff7467a47f1f63796d0e13ee1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"31152210b54aa91edab0c14d72dcc1ab0f536768ee78ebe8813925c653e94402","logical_entry_identity":"de7d41b9e4353f5719e5fbd3e49b7872964f6c4ecbe8b2f4d82a9934d5ce3293","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_BLUE#Offhand-Dual Weapon%s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"#LIGHT_BLUE#副手双持武器%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fdfeedc37f5e98fbe712fe3ecd56411c199ce81d9d16bb2e0774b918e82e150c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"31181e0d6e6709f49516e660148c74fdae0282e24e99b5885fab06d50bbc5dc2","logical_entry_identity":"496114dc898c5c80137591babd5cf18d0f95a3f9ebe0160ffe453caaffdced01","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Minimap","source_tag":"_t","target":"小地图"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"301ca85d899bf3020832c705f260271cf195caf4bc37727d278b109fbec1c389","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"31188dc7cbcb3da3858528d4e963c9cea35ff91659e603718405ab0d508fa85d","logical_entry_identity":"93e90f6ffd049c6495746910466255a70aebb8c5a18e268a20d99e0e2150bd02","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target#'s deep wound closes.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#的重伤愈合了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a753f1d7707503a